"What a wonderful world

2470
01:59:15,201 --> 01:59:19,069
"And I think to myself

2471
01:59:19,205 --> 01:59:22,606
"What a wonderful world...

2472
01:59:32,218 --> 01:59:36,120
"And I say to myself

2473
